<title>SPAIN: Treasury sets first auction of strippable debt.</title>
<headline>Treasury sets first auction of strippable debt.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Treasury announced on Friday the first auction of strippable debt in July.</p>
<p>&quot;The Treasury announced the first auction of strippable bonds and obligations corresponding to the month of July,&quot; the Treasury said in a brief statement.</p>
<p>In its initial announcement, the Treasury said the auction would be held in tandem with other regular monthly auctions, set next month for July 1 and 2.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
